00:52:18.410 --> 00:52:21.190
<v Brian Schatz>I vote no on behalf of people who need mental health care.
<v Brian Schatz>我投票反对，代表需要精神卫生保健的人们。

00:52:21.190 --> 00:52:22.790
<v Presiding Officer>Debate is not allowed during the vote.
<v Presiding Officer>投票期间禁止辩论。

00:52:22.790 --> 00:52:25.730
