<v Presiding Officer>来自伊利诺伊州的先生。

00:52:27.620 --> 00:52:30.650
<v Dick Durbin>On behalf of the Downstate hospitals of Illinois, I vote--
<v Dick Durbin>代表伊利诺伊州南部下游的医院，我投票——

00:52:30.650 --> 00:52:32.960
<v Presiding Officer>Debate is not in order during a vote.
<v Presiding Officer>投票期间辩论不符合秩序。

00:52:32.960 --> 00:52:37.940
<v Clerk>Mr. Durbin, no. Ms. Klobuchar.
<v Clerk>德宾先生（Mr. Durbin），反对。克洛布查尔女士（Ms. Klobuchar）。

00:52:37.940 --> 00:52:40.080
<v Amy Klobuchar>Because there is no plan in the alternative--
<v Amy Klobuchar>因为替代方案中没有计划——

00:52:40.080 --> 00:52:40.490
<v Presiding Officer>Debate is not allowed--
<v Presiding Officer>禁止辩论——

00:52:40.490 --> 00:52:41.380
<v Amy Klobuchar>--I vote no.
<v Amy Klobuchar>——我投票反对。

00:52:41.380 --> 00:52:42.190
<v Presiding Officer>--will be in order.
<v Presiding Officer>——将符合秩序。

00:52:42.190 --> 00:52:44.500
<v Clerk>Ms. Klobuchar, no.
<v Clerk>克洛布查尔女士，反对。

00:52:44.500 --> 00:52:47.450
<v Presiding Officer>[INAUDIBLE] order. Debate is not in order during a vote.
<v Presiding Officer>（听不清）秩序。投票期间辩论不符合秩序。

00:52:47.450 --> 00:52:49.310
<v Presiding Officer>Debate is not an order during a vote.
