00:52:52.340 --> 00:52:53.210
<v Clerk>Mr. Kaine.
<v Clerk>凯恩先生（Mr. Kaine）。

00:52:53.210 --> 00:52:54.670
<v Tim Kaine>When I was sick, you visited me--
