00:53:04.130 --> 00:53:06.220
<v Heidi Heitkamp>--people who receive health care in my state and rural hospital--
<v Heidi Heitkamp>——在我国和乡村医院接受医疗的人们——

00:53:06.220 --> 00:53:07.040
<v Presiding Officer>Debate is not allowed.
<v Presiding Officer>禁止辩论。

00:53:07.040 --> 00:53:09.590
<v Heidi Heitkamp>--who know not how they're going to get her health care--
<v Heidi Heitkamp>——不知道如果这在没有——

00:53:09.590 --> 00:53:09.840
<v Presiding Officer>Senator will suspend.
<v Presiding Officer>参议员请暂停。

00:53:09.840 --> 00:53:10.190
<v Heidi Heitkamp>--if this passes without--
<v Heidi Heitkamp>——通过的情况下如何获得医疗——

00:53:10.190 --> 00:53:11.420
